<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
    .header { text-align: center; padding: 20px 0; }
    .logo { font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; color: #6366f1; }
    .content { background: #f9fafb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 30px; margin: 20px 0; }
    .button { display: inline-block; background: #6366f1; color: white; padding: 14px 28px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; margin: 20px 0; }
    .footer { text-align: center; color: #6b7280; font-size: 14px; padding: 20px 0; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="header">
    <div class="logo">Memflect</div>
  </div>
  
  <div class="content">
    <h2>Thank you for your purchase! 🎉</h2>
    
    <p>Your personalized 5-minute Memflection is now being created. This usually takes 2-3 minutes.</p>
    
    <p>We're using your voice and your memory to craft something truly unique - a reflection that's entirely yours.</p>
    
    <p style="text-align: center;">
      <a href="<%= @dashboard_url %>" class="button">View Your Memflection →</a>
    </p>
    
    <p><strong>What happens next:</strong></p>
    <ul>
      <li>Our AI is writing your personalized script</li>
      <li>Your cloned voice will narrate the reflection</li>
      <li>We'll blend it with your chosen soundscape</li>
      <li>You'll receive access to download and replay anytime</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  
  <div class="footer">
    <p>Questions? Just reply to this email.</p>
    <p>© <%= Date.current.year %> Memflect</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
